{#
  Inline stroke icons for the Cuprum sub-site.

  Every icon is decorative: it sits beside a word that already says the same
  thing, so each carries aria-hidden and no title. The paths are drawn on a
  24-unit grid in the prototype's hand, at a 1.8 stroke, and take the colour
  of the text around them. The one exception is `chevron-solid`, a filled
  triangle that marks a drop-down. Import as `icons` and call
  `icons.icon('check')`.
#}
